00:57:09.860 --> 00:57:11.840
say at that quantum state.

00:57:15.950 --> 00:57:18.425
So this is the energy
of the electron system.

00:57:21.907 --> 00:57:23.990
And, of course, you can
take a derivative of this.

00:57:23.990 --> 00:57:25.073
Again, it's specific heat.

00:57:28.410 --> 00:57:29.640
But you have one trouble.

00:57:29.640 --> 00:57:32.220
