01:06:22.530 --> 01:06:29.430
And if I do any measurement,
I have to over a certain time.

01:06:29.430 --> 01:06:36.458
I will integrate that, say,
quantity over this time

01:06:36.458 --> 01:06:37.500
and get the time average.

01:06:37.500 --> 01:06:39.900
That's what I can measure.

01:06:39.900 --> 01:06:43.950
Nobody can say I'm
going to measure really

01:06:43.950 --> 01:06:47.890
instantaneous energy there.

01:06:47.890 --> 01:06:50.550
So that's the time
average of any quantity.

01:06:53.360 --> 01:06:59.975
And this is a system I have, and
I measure the average quantity.

01:06:59.975 --> 01:07:06.080
But in statistics, it's
hard to do time treatment.

01:07:06.080 --> 01:07:10.700
The time treatment, you need to
